# What the image build never sees. Patterns start with **/ so they cover every part's folder, not
# only the app root.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/bin/
**/obj/
server/out/
server/public/
.git/
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
README.md

# No env file reaches the image. The committed .env is local-development config: the build would
# load it, and the service runs on the configuration Cloud Run holds for it, never a file.
**/.env*
